# Build context for the Dockerfile. The image needs the pnpm workspace sources and nothing else.
# Patterns here are anchored at the context root, unlike .gitignore, so anything that can appear
# below a package or an app needs a `**/` prefix. Do not exclude a directory that is a pnpm
# workspace member (see pnpm-workspace.yaml): `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` needs every member.

# Version control, CI and agent tooling
.git
.github
.claude

# Dependencies and build output (the image installs and builds from scratch)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Local configuration and secrets, at the root and in every app. Only the examples are tracked.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Editor files and docs
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
LICENSE
docker-compose.yml
